+## Filtering
+
+A filter bar above the grid narrows the list by name (every whitespace-separated
+term must match the first or last name, ignoring case and accents) and by status.
+The summary line shows how many customers match. The filter is applied by
+`CustomerRepository`, so the grid still loads one page at a time, and it is kept
+in the URL as `name` and `status` query parameters, for example
+`/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED`.
